  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>YCK的自动火把</strong></p>\n<p>本模组添加了“火把放置器”物品，让你能够专心于挖矿。当该物品被启用且玩家背包中存在火把时，它会检测当前光照等级是否低于5，若满足条件则自动放置一个火把。</p>\n<p><strong>合成配方：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f5b12c99-1017-4944-b347-384e110761ac.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<p><strong>动态变化的纹理：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2e4ecb19-83dc-47a3-9fa5-64f4b1209e49.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"267\" height=\"91\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a1809471-8ef0-4c89-b3fd-811c56f276a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"271\" height=\"95\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>描述信息：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ffc18cf4-5323-4848-bfb1-35403f1d9111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"137\"></strong></p>",
